Upstream-Name: violoop-edge-kiosk-qt
Upstream-Contact: doctor <doctor@bvio.ai>
Source: https://github.com/BvioTech/violoop-edge-front3
Comment:
 The complete corresponding source of this package is in that repository.
 A release, version X.Y.Z, is built from the git tag vX.Y.Z.
 SOURCE_REVISION_PLACEHOLDER
 .
 At run time the program links against the violoop-qt6 package (Qt 6.8.5,
 installed under /opt/violoop-qt6), which is not part of this package and
 carries its own copyright file. That build includes Qt Quick 3D, which
 The Qt Company offers under "LicenseRef-Qt-Commercial OR GPL-3.0-only"
 (no LGPL option); that is why this program is distributed under the GPL.
 The scripts that build violoop-qt6, and the exact upstream refs they
 pull, are at https://github.com/BvioTech/violoop-qt-build.

