Files: assets/away/VIO_DesktopPet.glb
Copyright: 2026 BvioTech
License: LicenseRef-BvioTech-Proprietary
Comment:
 The mascot model, made by BvioTech. It is not part of the executable:
 it is installed as a separate file,
 /opt/violoop-edge-kiosk-qt/assets/away/VIO_DesktopPet.glb, which the
 program reads at run time as data (a glTF file). It is not covered by
 the program's GPL license.

